# The Little Prince — text->image morph: a page of the rose/fox farewell set in Skia
# glyphs (Atlas) flies together into the prince illustration; a corner FAB toggles
# page <-> picture (spring progress + 240ms icon crossfade + Pulsar haptic
# pattern), with a 400ms double-fire debounce.
# What this test covers: toggling as soon as the FAB is available (sampling of
# the image targets is deferred past first paint), full page->picture->page
# morphs with settles, re-toggling mid-morph (spring reversed), taps inside
# the 400ms debounce window (ignored), a burst of taps, taps on the page
# itself (no effect).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/the-little-prince"
wait "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\"" 10000
press "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\""
wait 2500
press "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\""
wait 2500
press "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\""
wait 2500
press "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\""
wait 2500
# Reverse mid-morph.
press "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\""
wait 600
press "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\""
wait 2500
# Inside the debounce window: the second tap is ignored.
press "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\""
wait 100
press "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\""
wait 2500
# Burst.
press "label=\"Switch between the text and the picture\"" --count 6 --interval-ms 150
wait 2500
# Taps on the page.
press 201 300
wait 300
press 120 600
wait 800
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
